# Interaction with mobilize: after the Headliner attacks, its Warrior token and an Ornithopter are creatures Bot1
# controls. Sacrificing the attacking Headliner (it leaves combat) deals damage equal to the 2 left (Warrior and
# Ornithopter), killing Bot2's 0/2 Ornithopter. The Warrior still attacks and deals 1 to Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Stadium Headliner
Ornithopter
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stadium Headliner.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Stadium Headliner)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Stadium Headliner.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
? Bot1.Battlefield.Warrior Token.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Stadium Headliner
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
